					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1331375#post-2783677</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1331375/surprise-happy-birthday-now-see-here#post-2783677</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 04 Apr 2017 21:14:10 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Dr Gears</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>172464</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I love each and every one of you.</p> <p>I am sorry for my&#8230;absence.</p> <p>I have in fact been working on a novel&#8230;but I miss this, i miss all of you. It's been such a time, but maybe, maybe, I have a few entries left in me, somewhere. A few rattling moans to give you.</p> <p>I love you all, i want you to know this.</p> <p>I've been without any network connection for nearly a year, had a few breakdowns, children, and went through&#8230;well, hell, in many ways. Yet i always thought of you, all of you. I miss you, and i want to be&#8230;part of it all again.</p> <p>I love you, down to the last hair on your head.</p> <p>And because i love you</p> <p>I want to make you suffer</p> <p>so sorry for the wait.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
