					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1331375#post-2362144</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1331375/surprise-happy-birthday-now-see-here#post-2362144</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2015 04:04:09 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>minmin</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>560062</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I &lt;3 creepypasta. As much as I love all the SCPs on this site and stuff, it was a lot of the creepypasta in the archives that drew me into being a member on this site and spending hours after school (and after dark) reading shittily-word-wrapped tales on my tiny lil' phone. And Gears' stuff was a big part of that experience, of going to bed at one in the morning waiting for impossible things to happen in the corners of my vision, of listening for sounds of scratching behind the walls, of never looking behind my shoulder, no matter what.</p> <p>Have this humble hasty pasta as tribute.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
